   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "entity",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Your word.** What everyone says on the desk — the company, not the listing.\n\nTicker is the code; the Name is the company. That distinction has a consequence: if a Name can carry more than one Ticker, a Signal is about the company and a Position is probably about the listing."
   },
